{"slug":"/references/utils/enums/utils.RefundStatus","title":"RefundStatus","frontmatter":{},"toc":[{"title":"Enumeration Members","id":"enumeration-members","level":2},{"title":"PENDING","id":"pending","level":3},{"title":"SUCCEEDED","id":"succeeded","level":3},{"title":"FAILED","id":"failed","level":3}],"blocks":[{"kind":"markdown","html":"The status of a refund."},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Enumeration Members","id":"enumeration-members"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"text":"PENDING","id":"pending"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"**PENDING** = `\"pending\"`"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"The refund was recorded and sent to the payment provider, which hasn't\nanswered yet."},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"text":"SUCCEEDED","id":"succeeded"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"**SUCCEEDED** = `\"succeeded\"`"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"The payment provider confirmed the refund."},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"text":"FAILED","id":"failed"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"**FAILED** = `\"failed\"`"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"The payment provider didn't confirm the refund. The record is soft-deleted\nand kept so the refund can be retried with the same idempotency key."}]}